eave behind.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869840/extras/0862ad40b1ee2f9c89e297d1b8c1cc2a.poster.avif?t=1783185881\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869840/extras/0862ad40b1ee2f9c89e297d1b8c1cc2a.webm?t=1783185881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869840/extras/0862ad40b1ee2f9c89e297d1b8c1cc2a.mp4?t=1783185881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A WEALTH OF CAREFULLY CRAFTED ITEMS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will not find mountains of boring stat-bonuses here. <strong>Each of our 117 collectable items was designed with a purpose and to interact deeply with its siblings.</strong> <i>Found an item that allows you to transform enemies into money? Great! Can you find a way to remove its cooldown?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869840/extras/03df8e96902febea7e3afbad41b04d7e.poster.avif?t=1783185881\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869840/extras/03df8e96902febea7e3afbad41b04d7e.webm?t=1783185881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869840/extras/03df8e96902febea7e3afbad41b04d7e.mp4?t=1783185881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NO HAND HOLDING HERE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't let the cute style deceive you! The forest is does not welcome the weak. Only those who spend their time efficiently, learn to exploit opportunity, and attend to details will survive. <strong>Many core mechanics in this game are not explicitly explained and are left for you to discover through experimentation and failure.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE A BEAUTIFUL AND METICULOUSLY DESIGNED WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the flora and fauna found in the pacific northwest, this handcrafted environment is as breathtaking as it is unforgiving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869840/extras/271e318e76aea1185990a95693a463bc.poster.avif?t=1783185881\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869840/extras/271e318e76aea1185990a95693a463bc.webm?t=1783185881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869840/extras/271e318e76aea1185990a95693a463bc.mp4?t=1783185881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENDLESS REPLAYABILITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether it's your 10th, 100th, or 1000th hour of play, these deeply-connected systems and mechanics constantly produce novel situations that will test your knowledge, skills, and creativity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MADE BY HUMANS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Artificial Intelligence was not used to create any part of this game.</strong> All art, code, music, sound effects, design choices, marketing materials, and everything else was <u>made exclusively by human minds and hands</u>, without the use of any AI tools.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT ARE YOU WAITING FOR?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A deep forest lies before you, ready to be explored...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta